                <p class="project-card__desc">
                    Self-hosted multi-service production infrastructure running on bare metal exposed through Cloudflare zero-trust tunnels (kalp.dev). Built with automated multi-database backup pipelines to offsite encrypted cloud storage, automated disaster recovery scripts, and a continuous 24-test Python integration verification suite.
