                    <span class="project-tag">React</span>
                    <span class="project-tag">Node.js</span>
                    <span class="project-tag">Express</span>
                    <span class="project-tag">AWS DynamoDB</span>
                    <span class="project-tag">RBAC</span>
                    <span class="project-tag">REST APIs</span>
                </div>
                <h2 class="project-card__title">Multi-Tenant Corporate Cafeteria &amp; Catering Platform</h2>
                <p class="project-card__desc">
                    Full-stack corporate catering and meal scheduling platform built for enterprise multi-tenancy. Features fine-grained Role-Based Access Control (Admin, Company Manager, Food Vendor, Employee), a strict 12-hour ordering lockouts business rules engine, and NoSQL data modeling on AWS DynamoDB.
                </p>
                <div class="project-card__links">
                    <a href="https://github.com/Kalp-S/OnlineCafeSystem" class="project-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
