            <!-- 4. javaSecureFileTransfer -->
            <div class="project-card">
                <div class="project-card__tags">
                    <span class="project-tag">Java</span>
                    <span class="project-tag">Network Security</span>
                    <span class="project-tag">DES &amp; RSA</span>
                    <span class="project-tag">TCP Sockets</span>
                    <span class="project-tag">Needham-Schroeder</span>
                </div>
                <h2 class="project-card__title">Authenticated Cryptographic Protocol &amp; Socket Suite</h2>
                <p class="project-card__desc">
                    End-to-end cryptographic client-server protocol implemented in Java over raw TCP sockets. Implements mutual challenge-response authentication with replay-resistant nonces, hybrid RSA asymmetric handshaking, symmetric DES session cipher negotiation, and packetized encrypted binary file streaming.
                </p>
                <div class="project-card__links">
                    <a href="https://github.com/Kalp-S/javaSecureFileTransfer" class="project-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
