                <h2 class="project-card__title">Zero-Sum Game Theory &amp; Minimax Decision Engine</h2>
                <p class="project-card__desc">
                    Interactive browser application powered by a recursive zero-sum Minimax decision tree with depth-penalized utility scoring, rendering the AI mathematically unbeatable in React. Features state-driven board rendering, difficulty toggle, and persistent session scoring.
